---
// Interactive BioCosmos architecture, drawn from the BioCosmos backend
// (backend/app/main.py, services/agent.py, database/). It shares the NAHPU
// diagram's visual language: here forest is Python services, moss is AI
// models, and mist is embedded data. Hover, focus, or tap a component to read
// what it does, or pick an example question to trace it through the system.
